      ],
      "purpose": "`eventoutbox` composes the public event-sourcing PostgreSQL writer and the public outbox PostgreSQL writer. Neither core imports the other. `Stager` writes event rows and one outbox envelope per event through a savepoint inside an existing caller-owned `pgx.Tx`. It releases that savepoint only after both batches stage and rolls it back after any error. The adapter never commits or publishes from the outer transaction and never claims exactly-once delivery.",
